it really, really, really
means a lot to me, man,

00:04:56.472 --> 00:04:58.311
and I hope you're enjoying the read.

00:04:58.311 --> 00:05:00.282
So that you guys again for watching

00:05:00.282 --> 00:05:01.224
I believe in you.

00:05:01.224 --> 00:05:03.413
I hope you can continue
to believe in yourself

00:05:03.413 --> 00:05:05.737
and whatever your one word is.

00:05:05.737 --> 00:05:08.278
Much love and I'll see
you again tomorrow morning

00:05:08.278 --> 00:05:10.636
for another shot of espresso.

00:05:10.636 --> 00:05:13.765
♫ I wake up every morning

00:05:13.765 --> 00:05:15.620
♫ Espresso keep me going

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:19.572
♫ I wake up every morning

00:05:19.572 --> 00:05:21.164
- [Interviewer] You don't
pay a lot of attention to

00:05:21.164 --> 00:05:23.031
reviews and those kind of things?

00:05:23.031 --> 00:05:25.955
- Well, you know, you're
always affected by opinion,

00:05:25.955 --> 00:05:29.205
but the more opinions there are of you,

00:05:30.096 --> 00:05:31.596
of me, the more I,

00:05:33.442 --> 00:05:35.189
the less I look at them.

00:05:35.189 --> 00:05:36.739
Because I just can't live my life

00:05:36.739 --> 00:05:39.269
based on what other people think about me.

00:05:39.269 --> 00:05:40.550
So I can't concern myself too much

00:05:40.550 --> 00:05:42.317
with other people's thing, you know,

00:05:42.317 --> 00:05:43.698
it's just not healthy.

00:05:43.698 --> 00:05:45.815
I don't think I could continue to do

00:05:45.815 --> 00:05:47.920
what I do if I was
constantly worrying about

00:05:47.920 --> 00:05:50.503
what somebody thought about it.

00:06:54.742 --> 00:06:57.900
- You know, how did you
ignore all those naysayers

00:06:57.900 --> 00:07:00.389
and continue to blaze the trail?

00:07:00.389 --> 00:07:04.116
- Well, 90 to 95% of all new ventures fail

00:07:04.116 --> 00:07:06.820
so if you just bet
against all new ventures

00:07:06.820 --> 00:07:09.111
the odds are 90% that
you're going to be right

00:07:09.111 --> 00:07:11.171
90% of the time,

00:07:11.171 --> 00:07:14.828
but you're going to
miss that one out of 10

00:07:14.828 --> 00:07:16.351
or one out of 20 chances

00:07:16.351 --> 00:07:18.434
to really hit a home run.

00:07:19.896 --> 00:07:23.965
And I wasn't worried about the naysayers

00:07:23.965 --> 00:07:25.233
saying it wasn't going to work,

00:07:25.233 --> 00:07:29.281
I just laughed about it,
because I knew it was.

00:07:29.281 --> 00:07:30.722
- And you worked very hard at it as well.

00:07:30.722 --> 00:07:33.065
- I wasn't going to let it fail.

00:07:33.065 --> 00:07:36.819
And if you read my book, it's right there.

00:07:36.819 --> 00:07:39.321
I wasn't going to let it fail

00:07:39.321 --> 00:07:41.146
and I'm not going to let

00:07:41.146 --> 00:07:44.799
humanity fail to get
rid of nuclear weapons

00:07:44.799 --> 00:07:47.216
and handle this energy thing.

00:07:48.233 --> 00:07:51.431
I'm going to keep fighting
until we start getting it right.

